@startuml
title HCP-D04 Passageway Projection Flow
skinparam shadowing false

participant "HikCentral connector" as Connector
participant "HCP passageway records" as HCP
participant "Central PMS projection" as Central
participant "Operator Console" as OC
participant "Management Dashboard" as MDR
participant "Continuity workflow" as Cont
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Connector -> HCP : poll passageway records\n(one-minute planning baseline)
HCP --> Connector : passageway facts
Connector -> Connector : normalize + apply AdapterMapping
Connector --> Central : projection input + freshness context
Central --> OC : health / stale warnings where authorized
Central --> MDR : operational visibility with freshness labels
Central --> Cont : degraded evidence only under policy
Central --> Audit : projection and freshness context

note bottom
Passageway projection is operational visibility.
It must not invent tariff or payment/exit status.
end note
@enduml
